<title>USA: JENNY CRAIG INC WINS $4.0 MLN INSURANCE SUIT.</title>
<headline>JENNY CRAIG INC WINS $4.0 MLN INSURANCE SUIT.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jenny Craig Inc said Thursday it has won $4.0 million from one of its insurance carriers to settle a lawsuit.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it will record a gain of about $0.10 a share in its fourth quarter, ending June 30.</p>
<p>The lawsuit was brought by Jenny Craig following the settlement of an April 1994 class action complaint against Jenny Craig.</p>
<p>&quot;After more than three years of litigation, we're pleased to put this matter behind us,&quot; said President and Chief Executive Joseph LaBonte.</p>
</text>
